{c_important}Armored Hide{/c} becomes a {c_important}Jaguar{/c} Skill that deals Fire damage. 

{c_label}Passive:{/c} Each time you take damage, gain a stack of {c_important}{u}Ferocity{/u}{/c}

{c_label}Active:{/c} Perform large slashes all around you, dealing {c_number}{payload:UPGRADE_C_ATTACK}{/c} damage twice. Restore {c_number}[{SF_30}*100|%|]{/c} of your Maximum Life each time this damages an enemy. Receive {c_number}[{SF_31}*100|%|]{/c} increased Healing for {c_number}[{SF_1}|1|]{/c} |4second:seconds;.
